- [Gary] Win.

00:06:06.542 --> 00:06:08.417
I grew up with parents,
amazing parents, who were like

00:06:08.417 --> 00:06:09.625
"Whatever you
start, you finish."

00:06:09.625 --> 00:06:10.250
- [Gary] Yeah.

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:11.667
