00:06:13.208 --> 00:06:14.708
"Nope, you're
finishing the whole season."

00:06:14.708 --> 00:06:16.208
I was never able
to quit anything.

00:06:16.208 --> 00:06:17.500
- [Gary] Interesting.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:20.375
- And I grew up with my
father, who was an entrepreneur

00:06:20.375 --> 00:06:21.959
who started a
business out of our garage

00:06:21.959 --> 00:06:23.375
