not paying for shit."

00:06:54.708 --> 00:06:56.542
- "We're not gonna be there,
we're not helping you,

00:06:56.542 --> 00:06:57.792
"you better find a job."
- [Gary] Yep.

00:06:57.792 --> 00:07:00.000
