00:22:14.959 --> 00:22:16.000
to kind of offset the income,

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:18.041
but in the beginning,
the biggest thing is

00:22:18.041 --> 00:22:20.166
you should take
as many jobs you can,

00:22:20.166 --> 00:22:22.375
as much as you can,
that is in this space.

00:22:22.375 --> 00:22:24.333
That doesn't mean you can't
still be doing other things

00:22:24.333 --> 00:22:26.125
but as a writer and
as a creative person,

00:22:26.125 --> 00:22:28.208
you need to be doing
as many things as you can

00:22:28.208 --> 00:22:31.708
to fulfill that creative quote
unquote job for yourself.

